        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai eŋoleŋoleete akonye nuka EJAKAIT anatar akwap kere, aitodikin akegogoŋ kanuka ŋul luetenito itauonokec kakonyeneke. Iswama nukabaŋaanut kanuŋ; naarai agear kwana ijaun kaijiisio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
